<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρᾰδος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ], ὁ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>disturbance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ χρωτὸς ἄ. ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					4.56
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐμποιεῖν</span>
				Id.<i>Acut.(Sp.)</i><i><span class="en">
				47
			</span></i>; also of foods, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VM</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχον ἄ. κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; <i>palpitation</i> of the heart, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. κακός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					775
				</span></i>
			: generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐκ τῆς συνουσίας ἄ.
				καὶ παλμός</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.654b
			</span></i>. (Prob. onomatop., 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄραβος.</span>
			)</div>
